  - key: exchange/row_intercepts
    values:
    - "<b>Intercepts</b> {0}"
    - "<b>Intercepte</b> {0}"
  - key: exchange/row_no_intercept
    values:
    - "<b>No intercept</b> \xB7 aims where targets arrive"
    - "<b>N'intercepte pas</b> \xB7 vise l'arriv\xE9e"
  - key: exchange/row_intercepted_by
    values:
    - "<b>Intercepted by</b> {0}"
    - "<b>Intercept\xE9e par</b> {0}"
  - key: exchange/row_never_intercepted
    values:
    - "<b>Never intercepted</b>"
    - "<b>Jamais intercept\xE9e</b>"
  - key: exchange/row_claim_hold
    values:
    - "<b>Holds the tile</b>: a unit walking onto it stops short"
    - "<b>Garde la case</b> : l'unit\xE9 qui y marche s'arr\xEAte avant"
  - key: exchange/row_claim_yield
    values:
    - "<b>Yields the tile</b> to a unit walking onto it"
    - "<b>C\xE8de la case</b> \xE0 une unit\xE9 qui y marche"
  - key: exchange/row_claim_coin
    values:
    - "<b>Coin-flip tile</b> against a unit walking onto it"
    - "<b>Case au sort</b> contre une unit\xE9 qui y marche"
  - key: exchange/reach_range
    values:
    - "the reach"
    - "de port\xE9e"
  - key: exchange/reach_area
    values:
    - "the area"
    - "de la zone"
  - key: exchange/text_intercepts
    values:
    - "A target that {0} during this tick is hit on the tile it leaves: that is Intercept."
    - "Une cible qui {0} pendant ce tick est touch\xE9e sur la case qu'elle quitte : c'est l'Interception."
  - key: exchange/text_misses_after
    values:
    - "A target that {0} is aimed where it arrives: leaving {1} dodges it."
    - "Une cible qui {0} est vis\xE9e l\xE0 o\xF9 elle arrive : sortir {1} l'esquive."
  - key: exchange/text_misses
    values:
    - "A target that {0} during this tick is aimed where it arrives: leaving {1} dodges it."
    - "Une cible qui {0} pendant ce tick est vis\xE9e l\xE0 o\xF9 elle arrive : sortir {1} l'esquive."
  - key: exchange/text_mover
    values:
    - "While the unit moves, {0} attacks hit it on the tile it leaves; the others aim where it arrives{1}."
    - "Pendant que l'unit\xE9 bouge, les attaques {0} la touchent sur la case qu'elle quitte ; les autres la visent l\xE0 o\xF9 elle arrive{1}."
  - key: exchange/text_mover_dodge
    values:
    - ": leaving their reach dodges them"
    - " : sortir de leur port\xE9e les esquive"
  - key: exchange/text_mover_never
    values:
    - "While the unit moves, every attack aims where it arrives."
    - "Pendant que l'unit\xE9 bouge, toutes les attaques la visent l\xE0 o\xF9 elle arrive."
  - key: exchange/text_claim_hold
    values:
    - "If a unit tries to walk onto the target tile during this tick, it stops short: the placement happens."
    - "Si une unit\xE9 veut marcher sur la case vis\xE9e pendant ce tick, elle s'arr\xEAte avant : la pose a lieu."
  - key: exchange/text_claim_yield
    values:
    - "If a unit walks onto the target tile during this tick, it goes through: the placement is cancelled."
    - "Si une unit\xE9 marche sur la case vis\xE9e pendant ce tick, elle passe : la pose est annul\xE9e."
  - key: exchange/text_claim_coin
    values:
    - "If a unit tries to walk onto the target tile during this tick, a coin flip decides who gets it."
    - "Si une unit\xE9 veut marcher sur la case vis\xE9e pendant ce tick, un tirage au sort d\xE9cide qui l'obtient."
  - key: keyword/auto_target
    values:
    - "Auto-target"
    - "Cible auto"
  - key: keyword/auto_target_desc
    values:
    - "Queued without aiming: on its tick the unit takes the closest enemy in reach and turns to it, unless you designated a target."
    - "Se place sans viser : \xE0 son tick, l'unit\xE9 prend l'ennemi le plus proche \xE0 port\xE9e et pivote vers lui, sauf si vous avez d\xE9sign\xE9 une cible."
  - key: keyword/multi_target
    values:
    - "Multi-target {0}"
    - "Multi-cible {0}"
  - key: keyword/multi_target_desc
    values:
    - "Hits up to {0} different targets."
    - "Touche jusqu'\xE0 {0} cibles diff\xE9rentes."
  - key: keyword/multi_hit
    values:
    - "Hits \xD7{0}"
    - "Coups \xD7{0}"
  - key: keyword/multi_hit_desc
    values:
    - "Strikes the same target {0} times."
    - "Frappe {0} fois la m\xEAme cible."
  - key: keyword/rush
    values:
    - "Rush"
    - "Ru\xE9e"
  - key: keyword/rush_desc
    values:
    - "Dashes toward the target, then strikes from the tile where the unit stops, next to it. Flank, cover and shield are read from that tile."
    - "S'\xE9lance vers la cible, puis frappe depuis la case o\xF9 l'unit\xE9 s'arr\xEAte, \xE0 c\xF4t\xE9 d'elle. Flanc, couvert et bouclier se lisent depuis cette case."
  - key: keyword/leap
    values:
    - "Leap"
    - "Saut"
  - key: keyword/leap_desc
    values:
    - "Jumps over obstacles and lands on a free tile."
    - "Bondit par-dessus les obstacles et atterrit sur une case libre."
  - key: keyword/shield
    values:
    - "Shield"
    - "Bouclier"
  - key: keyword/shield_desc
    values:
    - "Turns the shield to one of the 6 sides. It absorbs damage coming from that side until its HP run out."
    - "Tourne le bouclier vers l'un des 6 c\xF4t\xE9s. Il absorbe les d\xE9g\xE2ts qui arrivent par ce c\xF4t\xE9 jusqu'\xE0 \xE9puisement de ses PV."
  - key: keyword/deploy
    values:
    - "Deploy: {0}"
    - "Pose : {0}"
  - key: keyword/deploy_desc
    values:
    - "Places an object on a tile: {0}."
    - "Pose un objet sur une case : {0}."
  - key: keyword/deploy_limit
    values:
    - " At most {0} in play (counter on the button)."
    - " {0} en jeu au plus (compteur sur le bouton)."
  - key: keyword/relocate
    values:
    - "Relocate: {0}"
    - "D\xE9place : {0}"
  - key: keyword/relocate_desc
    values:
    - "Moves an object already placed to another tile: {0}."
    - "D\xE9place vers une autre case un objet d\xE9j\xE0 pos\xE9 : {0}."
  - key: keyword/free
    values:
    - "Free"
    - "Gratuite"
  - key: keyword/free_desc
    values:
    - "Attaches to the start of a queued action, costing no tick."
    - "Se greffe au d\xE9but d'une action de la file, sans co\xFBter de tick."
  - key: keyword/pulse
    values:
    - "Pulse {0}\u2013{1}"
    - "Onde {0}\u2013{1}"
  - key: keyword/pulse_desc
    values:
    - "Hits every tile {0} to {1} tiles around the unit, allies included."
    - "Touche toutes les cases situ\xE9es entre {0} et {1} cases autour de l'unit\xE9, alli\xE9s compris."
  - key: keyword/blast_desc
    values:
    - "Hits every tile within {0} tile{1} of the impact point, allies included. Walls do not stop the blast."
    - "Touche toutes les cases \xE0 {0} case{1} ou moins du point d'impact, alli\xE9s compris. Les murs n'arr\xEAtent pas l'explosion."
  - key: keyword/ray_desc
    values:
    - "Hits every tile on the line between the unit and the aimed tile, allies included."
    - "Touche chaque case de la ligne entre l'unit\xE9 et la case vis\xE9e, alli\xE9s compris."
  - key: keyword/cone_desc
    values:
    - "Hits the tiles of a {0} cone in front of the unit, {1}, allies included. Walls cut the cone."
    - "Touche les cases d'un c\xF4ne {0} devant l'unit\xE9, {1}, alli\xE9s compris. Un mur coupe le c\xF4ne."
  - key: keyword/cone_wide
    values:
    - "wide"
    - "large"
  - key: keyword/cone_narrow
    values:
    - "narrow"
    - "\xE9troit"
  - key: keyword/distance_exact
    values:
    - "at exactly {0} tiles"
    - "\xE0 {0} cases exactement"
  - key: keyword/distance_range
    values:
    - "{0} to {1} tiles away"
    - "de {0} \xE0 {1} cases"
  - key: keyword/arc_desc
    values:
    - "Strikes an arc around the impact point, on the side the unit faces, allies included. Walls do not stop it."
    - "Frappe en arc autour du point d'impact, du c\xF4t\xE9 o\xF9 regarde l'unit\xE9, alli\xE9s compris. Les murs n'arr\xEAtent pas l'arc."
  - key: keyword/chain_desc
    values:
    - "After the target, bounces to up to {0} other enemies within {1} tiles; -{2}% damage per bounce. Spares allies."
    - "Apr\xE8s la cible, rebondit sur {0} autres ennemis au plus, \xE0 {1} cases ou moins ; -{2} % de d\xE9g\xE2ts par rebond. \xC9pargne les alli\xE9s."
  - key: keyword/lingering
    values:
    - "Lingering"
    - "Au sol"
  - key: keyword/lingering_desc
    values:
    - "Hit tiles keep {0} for {1}."
    - "Les cases touch\xE9es gardent {0} pendant {1}."
  - key: keyword/status_gain
    values:
    - "Gains {0}"
    - "Gagne {0}"
  - key: keyword/status_remove
    values:
    - "Removes {0}"
    - "Retire {0}"
  - key: keyword/status_chance_note
    values:
    - "Action, weapon and unit chance, before the target's resistance."
    - "Chance de l'action, de l'arme et de l'unit\xE9, avant la r\xE9sistance de la cible."
  - key: keyword/push
    values:
    - "Push {0}"
    - "Repousse {0}"
  - key: keyword/push_desc
    values:
    - "Moves the target {0} tile{1} away. If a wall or a unit stops it: {2} collision damage to each. Pushed into the void, it falls unless Flying."
    - "\xC9loigne la cible de {0} case{1}. Si un mur ou une unit\xE9 l'arr\xEAte : {2} d\xE9g\xE2ts de collision \xE0 chacun. Pouss\xE9e dans le vide, elle tombe, sauf en Vol."
  - key: keyword/pull
    values:
    - "Pull {0}"
    - "Attire {0}"
  - key: keyword/pull_desc
    values:
    - "Draws the target {0} tile{1} closer, with the same collision and void rules as Push."
    - "Rapproche la cible de {0} case{1}, avec les m\xEAmes r\xE8gles de collision et de vide que Repousse."
  - key: keyword/self_destruct
    values:
    - "Self-destruct"
    - "Autodestruction"
  - key: keyword/self_destruct_desc
    values:
    - "The unit destroys itself. Its on-death effects, such as a chassis explosion, trigger."
    - "L'unit\xE9 se d\xE9truit. Ses effets \xE0 la mort, comme l'explosion d'un ch\xE2ssis, se d\xE9clenchent."
  - key: keyword/steady
    values:
    - "Anchored"
    - "Ancrage"
  - key: keyword/steady_chip
    values:
    - "Anchored: {0}"
    - "Ancrage : {0}"
  - key: keyword/steady_desc
    values:
    - "If the unit has not moved earlier this round: {0}."
    - "Si l'unit\xE9 ne s'est pas d\xE9plac\xE9e plus t\xF4t dans ce tour : {0}."
  - key: keyword/hunt
    values:
    - "Hunter"
    - "Traque"
  - key: keyword/hunt_chip
    values:
    - "Hunter: {0}"
    - "Traque : {0}"
  - key: keyword/hunt_desc
    values:
    - "Against a Marked target: {0}. The mark is then removed."
    - "Contre une cible Marqu\xE9e : {0}. La marque est alors retir\xE9e."
  - key: keyword/unique
    values:
    - "Once per match"
    - "Unique"
  - key: keyword/unique_desc
    values:
    - "Can be used once per match."
    - "Utilisable une seule fois par match."
  - key: keyword/no_attack
    values:
    - "No attack first"
    - "Sans attaque"
  - key: keyword/no_attack_desc
    values:
    - "Only usable if the unit has not attacked earlier this round."
    - "Utilisable seulement si l'unit\xE9 n'a pas attaqu\xE9 plus t\xF4t dans ce tour."
  - key: keyword/curved_shot
    values:
    - "Curved shot"
    - "Tir courbe"
  - key: keyword/curved_shot_desc
    values:
    - "Bends once around a wall, on any tile that lets sight through. Range counts the real path; flank and cover are read from the bend."
    - "Contourne un mur avec un seul virage, sur une case qui laisse passer la vue. La port\xE9e se compte sur le trajet r\xE9el ; flanc et couvert se lisent depuis le virage."
  - key: keyword/quick_draw
    values:
    - "Quick draw"
    - "D\xE9gainage rapide"
  - key: keyword/quick_draw_desc
    values:
